        "data": {
            "key": "W9ZURLS3",
            "version": 16,
            "parentItem": "EEZPTBM9",
            "itemType": "note",
            "note": "<div data-schema-version=\"8\"><p>Task: Improve LLM performance on table tasks.</p>\n<p>Approaches: 4 steps. Judge, Critic, Refiner, and Curator. </p>\n<p>Judge: Judge if the answer is correct.</p>\n<p>Critic: generating critiques for the identified errors.</p>\n<p>Refiner: Correcting the error given the critique.</p>\n<p>Curator: Distill the error and update the template tree of errors.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>Result:</p>\n<p>Relatively good improvement over various datasets, over various benchmarks and compared to various baselines. Table Critic show, well, slight improvement.</p>\n</div>",
